    "detailed_description": "Life of Kanji Island is a game that helps you understand the \u2018meaning\u2019 of Japanese Kanji characters.<br>Survive the island where all elements are composed of Kanji and master the Kanji!<br><br><strong>Features</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You can learn the meanings of kanji.</h2>As you play the game, you can naturally learn the meaning of kanji from various information about kanji (color, size, pronunciation, description, and relationship with other kanji).<br>Once you understand the meaning of a kanji, it will be easier to guess the meaning of a Japanese sentence.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Omit extra information</h2>There are a large number of kanji, each of which has various readings, but there are also many kanji and readings that are almost never used today.<br>In this game, such kanji are omitted and limited to those used in daily life in Japan today, so that you can efficiently memorize the kanji you need to learn Japanese.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About 200 Kanji that appear in the game</h2>There are more than 10,000 kanji, but the number of kanji used daily in Japan is only about one-tenth of the total.<br>By playing this game, you can learn about 20%(50% if you include the description!) of the kanji used in daily life.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explanation against the Background of Japanese Culture</h2>By setting the language setting to Japanese, the explanations of kanji characters are explained in detail against the background of Japanese culture.<br>When you get used to the game, try setting the language to Japanese!<br>It might give you a clue to the game...?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to play</h2><br><strong>1. gather materials</strong><br><br>Click on one of the cards on the left side of the screen to collect the material corresponding to the card.<br>For example, clicking on the \u201c\u5ca9\u201d card will give you \u201c\u9244\u201d, etc. The materials are stored in the inventory on the right side of the screen.<br>The acquired materials are stored in the inventory on the right side of the screen.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006990/extras/85dfbc77b9f1be3d72c1daae6a5a7da7.poster.avif?t=1726212276\" width=600 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006990/extras/85dfbc77b9f1be3d72c1daae6a5a7da7.webm?t=1726212276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006990/extras/85dfbc77b9f1be3d72c1daae6a5a7da7.mp4?t=1726212276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>2. let's make things</strong><br><br>By combining the materials you have collected, you can make various items necessary for survival.<br>Select the \u201c\u88fd\u4f5c\u201d button, then the \u201c\u4e00\u89a7\u201d button, and select the items you want to make.<br>The left side of the list shows the required materials and the right side shows the items to be made.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006990/extras/559d4b3e12e76c92484f3600672b5558.avif?t=1726212276\" width=600 height=74 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006990/extras/02b13da11e34d2644b597c98c650afe1.poster.avif?t=1726212276\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006990/extras/02b13da11e34d2644b597c98c650afe1.webm?t=1726212276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006990/extras/02b13da11e34d2644b597c98c650afe1.mp4?t=1726212276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>3. what to do at the beginning</strong><br><br>First, we need to build a \u201c\u711a\u304d\u706b\u201d, a \u201c\u706f\u201d and a \u201c\u4f5c\u696d\u53f0\u201d.<br>When you build a \u201c\u711a\u304d\u706b\u201d, you will be able to make \u201c\u706f\u201d and various food items.<br>When you build a \u201c\u4f5c\u696d\u53f0\u201d, you will be able to make a variety of tools.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006990/extras/b91185c63d200e7b67ff0cd9950ba1eb.poster.avif?t=1726212276\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006990/extras/b91185c63d200e7b67ff0cd9950ba1eb.webm?t=1726212276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006990/extras/b91185c63d200e7b67ff0cd9950ba1eb.mp4?t=1726212276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>4. let's equip it with lights</strong><br><br>At night, the cards become invisible and very dangerous.<br>By making a \u201c\u706f\u201d and equipping it in the \u201c\u5de6\u624b\u201d, the cards become visible.<br>Most tools have various effects when equipped.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006990/extras/54d37b822c5cafa0e88ade8fb07d800a.poster.avif?t=1726212276\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006990/extras/54d37b822c5cafa0e88ade8fb07d800a.webm?t=1726212276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006990/extras/54d37b822c5cafa0e88ade8fb07d800a.mp4?t=1726212276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>5. visit a new biome</strong><br><br>Some cards have a \u201c\u2190\u201d symbol in the upper left corner.<br>Selecting this card will move you to a new biome.<br>Explore the new biome and learn new kanji.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006990/extras/7172082b1db5a1654b7cd20a883220d7.avif?t=1726212276\" width=276 height=224 /></span><br><br>Explore different places and master the Kanji characters!",
